  "bodyHash": "caeb709b6204ff94",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Twitter&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Universal Enchants</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 擴大了 Minecraft 的附魔系統，允許附魔套用於更多物品、移除了不必要的相容性限制，並在此過程中優化了數個原版附魔。✨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">為什麼只有劍能獨佔樂趣？將 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掠奪</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 套用到三叉戟 🔱、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">無限</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 套用到弩 🏹、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">銳利</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 套用到斧頭 🪓，或將防護附魔套用到動物盔甲 🛡️。此模組在忠於原版玩法的同時，開啟了無數種新的搭配可能。⚔️</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">除了擴充相容性之外，數個附魔也獲得了實用的生活品質改善。</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">無限</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 真正實現了無限 ♾️，</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掠奪</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 與 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">幸運</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 能額外獎勵經驗值 💎，</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">多重射击</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 變得更加有效 🎯，還有更多。每項變更均可單獨設定 ⚙️，讓您打造最適合自己世界的附魔系統。✨</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更多武器可附魔：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 斧頭、三叉戟、錘子、弓、弩、盾牌與其他裝備現在可套用許多過去無法使用的現有附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">擴充遠程戰鬥：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 可在弓上套用 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">多重射击</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿透</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">快速裝填</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 與 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掠奪</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，或在弩上套用 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">力量</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">擊退</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">無限</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">火焰</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 與 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掠奪</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">強化三叉戟與錘子：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 可套用 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掠奪</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">擊退</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">銳利</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">對不死生物鋒芒</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">節肢殺手</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">刺穿</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">破甲</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 等附魔，創造出強大的新武器組合。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">附魔動物盔甲：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 馬盔、狼甲與潛水盔可享有許多盔甲附魔的效果，包含 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">防護</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">摔落緩衝</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">冰霜行者</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">靈魂疾行</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">荊棘</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 等。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">減少附魔限制：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 預設已相容熱門組合，例如 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">無限</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> + </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">經驗修復</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 以及 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">多重射击</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> + </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿透</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可選傷害附魔疊加：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 可設定讓 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">銳利</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 與 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">對不死生物鋒芒</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">節肢殺手</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">刺穿</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">破甲</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 同時生效，而非互斥。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可選防護附魔疊加：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 允許在同一件裝備上將 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">防護</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 與 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">火災防護</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">爆炸防護</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">彈射物防護</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 合併使用。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">✨ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">優化原版附魔：</span></strong> <em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">無限</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 不再需要保留一支箭矢，</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掠奪</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 與 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">幸運</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 會增加經驗掉落，</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">摔落緩衝</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 可防止耕地被踩踏，而 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">多重射击</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 則因移除彈射物免疫機制而受益。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">完全可設定：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 所有相容性變更與附魔調整均可透過資料包個別啟用、停用或完全自訂。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">客戶端與伺服器皆需安裝此模組</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（適用於 Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若模組支援，可直接在遊戲內透過模組選單進行設定（Fabric 版本需安裝由 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 開發的 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若需使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有設定檔均位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 資料夾中，依設定類型命名為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。並非所有模組都會具備全部類型的設定檔。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組隨附多個選用的資料包，用於擴充現有附魔可套用的物品範圍，並啟用新的附魔組合。每個資料包專注於特定的物品群組或附魔群組，且可獨立控制。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">建立世界時可於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">資料包</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 畫面中啟用或停用這些資料包，也可在既有世界與多人伺服器中使用 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">/datapack</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 指令來管理。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">詳細文件、所有隨附資料包的完整參考說明，以及本模組提供的額外資料包功能資訊，均可於 GitHub 上的 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">README.md</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 檔案中查看。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skeleton-ai-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/skeletonaifix/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tradingpost/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stoneworks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/stoneworks/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/death-finder\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/deathfinder/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/new-shroomcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/falling-leaves-plus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-monsters\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/leaves-be-gone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/leavesbegone/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/visualworkbench/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/stylisheffects/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
